      "content": "hey i need some help with something. i've been noticing some really weird patterns with my account at my local credit union lately and i'm starting to think they're actually trying to push me out. like every time i try to make a bigger purchase it gets flagged or there's a random \"service fee\" that wasn't there last week. it feels way too calculated to be a mistake. do you know how these banking systems work? like is there a way they can target specific people?",
